# Shared kernel / common header (I-RAM 0..59) -- hand-curated labels/comments.
# Part 1 of 2 of the RESIDENT KERNEL; part 2 is the output stage, epilogue.sym.
# A LITERAL canned blob at Sub CPU ROM 0x01E496, shipped by EFF_WriteHeader --
# nothing in it is computed by the firmware (PROVEN BY CONSTRUCTION,
# analysis/k5-output-stage.md).  See instruction-set.md "Control flow".
# Format: wNN  Label  ; comment   (only the FIRST comment line per word is emitted)

w0   Header          ; per-frame entry; sets up pointer registers then CALLs the unit bodies
w1                   ; C-format A=7; I-RAM 7 is the start of the second input block (INFERRED, n=1)
w7   InputBlock1     ; second of the two input blocks (blocks are 0..6 and 7..11) -- K6
w42  Unit0Setup      ; unit-0 pointer setup, and the DISCONNECT vector target for unit 0 [DETERMINED]
w49  Unit0Call       ; unit-tagged transfer, tag 0x0E -- CALLs the unit-0 body at I-RAM 84
w50  Unit1Setup      ; unit-1 pointer setup, and the DISCONNECT vector target for unit 1 [DETERMINED]
w59  Unit1Call       ; unit-tagged transfer, tag 0x0F -- CALLs the unit-1 body at I-RAM 200
